---
config:
  theme: base
---

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Startup
    Startup --> Ready: initialization complete

    Ready --> Training: shot candidate detected
    Training --> Ready: result displayed and logged

    Ready --> Calibration: threshold adjustment
    Calibration --> Ready: value applied

    Ready --> Connected: app connects
    Connected --> Ready: app disconnects

    Connected --> Debug: debug mode enabled
    Debug --> Connected: debug mode disabled

    Ready --> Error: invalid reading or failure
    Training --> Error: multiple shots detected
    Calibration --> Error: calibration out of range
    Connected --> Error: communication issue

    Error --> Ready: recoverable issue cleared
    Error --> LowBattery: battery warning
    LowBattery --> Ready: power restored or acknowledged
    LowBattery --> [*]: shutdown
